{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31590","headline":"仙明洲口号 · 李羣玉","name":"仙明洲口号","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长爱沙洲水竹居，暮江春树绿阴初。\n浪翻新月金波浅，风损轻云玉叶疎。\n半浦夜歌闻荡桨，一星幽火照叉鱼。\n二年此处寻佳句，景物常输楚客书。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31590.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31590","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}